+> **Not implemented yet:** `DUCKBRAIN_UI_PORT`, `DUCKBRAIN_GIT_REMOTE` and
+> `DUCKBRAIN_LOG_LEVEL` have no readers in the current code — setting them has
+> no effect. The HTTP port is the `duckbrain http --port=…` flag, and a
